---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LiveMetricsDemo from '../components/LiveMetricsDemo';
---
<Layout>
  <main class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 grid-glow opacity-40 [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,black,transparent_70%)]"></div>
    <nav class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-5 py-6 sm:px-8">
      <a href="/gait/" class="display flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-white"><span class="grid h-7 w-7 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-[#52e5d0] text-sm font-bold text-[#071313]">g</span> gait</a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5 text-sm text-slate-400"><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="#signals">Signals</a><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/gait/docs/">Docs</a><a class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-slate-200 transition hover:border-[#52e5d0]/50 hover:text-[#b8fff5]" href="https://github.com/0xJohnnyboy/gait">GitHub ↗</a></div>
    </nav>
    <section class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-20 pt-16 sm:px-8 sm:pt-24 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-32">
      <div class="max-w-4xl"><div class="eyebrow mb-6">behavioral signals · computed locally</div><h1 class="display max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[.98] text-white sm:text-7xl lg:text-[6.5rem]">See the signal<br /><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#52e5d0] via-[#80d9e2] to-[#9b8cff] bg-clip-text text-transparent">before it leaves.</span></h1><p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400 sm:text-xl">gait is a privacy-first TypeScript library for turning keyboard and pointer behavior into compact, explainable signals — right in the browser.</p><div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><a href="#demo" class="rounded-full bg-[#52e5d0] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#071313] shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(82,229,208,.18)] transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-[#8bf4e5]">See it live ↓</a><a href="/gait/docs/" class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 transition hover:border-white/25 hover:bg-white/[.04]">Read the docs →</a><span class="ml-1 text-xs text-slate-500">No backend. No raw event export.</span></div></div>
      <div class="mt-16"><LiveMetricsDemo client:load /></div>
    </section>
    <section id="signals" class="relative border-y border-white/[.06] bg-white/[.015]"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:py-28"><div><div class="eyebrow mb-5">one small layer</div><h2 class="display max-w-md text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">More context for the decisions that matter.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-md leading-7 text-slate-400">gait does not decide who is cheating. It gives your server a compact, local-first behavioral signal to weigh alongside your existing evidence.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="glass rounded-3xl p-6"><div class="mb-10 text-2xl">⌨︎</div><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Keyboard timing</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Dwell, flight, overlap and distribution shape — without capturing what was typed.</p></div><div class="glass rounded-3xl p-6"><div class="mb-10 text-2xl">⌁</div><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Pointer dynamics</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Velocity, acceleration, distance and input quality across mouse, pen and touch.</p></div><div class="glass rounded-3xl p-6"><div class="mb-10 text-2xl">◌</div><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Capture quality</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Accepted, rejected and interrupted observations with an explicit confidence signal.</p></div><div class="glass rounded-3xl p-6"><div class="mb-10 text-2xl">↗</div><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Built for correlation</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">A versioned snapshot your own systems can combine with context they already own.</p></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:py-28"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:items-center"><div><div class="eyebrow mb-5">small surface area</div><h2 class="display max-w-lg text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">A pure Core.<br />Thin adapters.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-lg leading-7 text-slate-400">The math lives in framework-agnostic TypeScript. Browser events are normalized once. React, Vue, Svelte and Angular only handle lifecycle and subscriptions.</p><a href="/gait/docs/architecture/" class="mt-7 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[#52e5d0] hover:text-[#b8fff5]">Explore the architecture →</a></div><div class="glass overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-6 font-mono text-sm leading-8 text-slate-400"><div class="mb-5 flex gap-2"><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#fb7185]"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#f6c76b]"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#52e5d0]"></span></div><div><span class="text-[#9b8cff]">const</span> gait = <span class="text-[#52e5d0]">createBrowserGait</span>();</div><div>gait.<span class="text-[#f6c76b]">start</span>();</div><div class="mt-3 text-slate-500">// aggregate locally, publish on your cadence</div><div>gait.<span class="text-[#f6c76b]">subscribe</span>((snapshot) =&gt; {'{'}</div><div class="pl-6">server.send(snapshot);</div><div>{'}'});</div></div></div></section>
    <section class="border-t border-white/[.06] bg-[#0b1020]"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col justify-between gap-8 px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 md:flex-row md:items-end"><div><div class="eyebrow mb-4">ready when you are</div><h2 class="display max-w-xl text-4xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">Start with a signal.<br />Build your own context.</h2></div><div class="flex gap-3"><a href="/gait/docs/quickstart/" class="rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#0b1020] transition hover:bg-[#b8fff5]">Quickstart →</a><a href="https://github.com/0xJohnnyboy/gait" class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white/[.06]">View source</a></div></div></section>
    <footer class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-3 px-5 py-8 text-xs text-slate-500 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-8"><span>gait · open-source behavioral metrics</span><span>Local-first by design · no identity claims</span></footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
